        "html": "<article class=\"source-page-card major-question-card\" id=\"major-question-02\" data-major-question-id=\"major-question-02\"><h2>Ⅱ</h2><p class=\"prose\">以下の問いに答えよ。解答欄には選択肢の記号（カタカナ）を記入すること。</p><h3>(A)</h3><p class=\"prose\">容器に100 gの水を入れ，容器と水を20 ℃にした。90 ℃の水100 gを加えると50 ℃になった。水の比熱を <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"4.2\\ \\mathrm{J/(g\\cdot K)}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">4.2\\ \\mathrm{J/(g\\cdot K)}</span> とし，熱の出入りは水と容器の間だけとする。容器の熱容量を選べ。</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values structured-list--cols-2\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ア</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"1.1\\times10^2\\ \\mathrm{J/K}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">1.1\\times10^2\\ \\mathrm{J/K}</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">イ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"1.4\\times10^2\\ \\mathrm{J/K}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">1.4\\times10^2\\ \\mathrm{J/K}</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ウ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"1.8\\times10^2\\ \\mathrm{J/K}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">1.8\\times10^2\\ \\mathrm{J/K}</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">エ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2.3\\times10^2\\ \\mathrm{J/K}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">2.3\\times10^2\\ \\mathrm{J/K}</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">オ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2.9\\times10^2\\ \\mathrm{J/K}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">2.9\\times10^2\\ \\mathrm{J/K}</span></div></div></div><h3>(B)</h3><p class=\"prose\">理想気体の圧力は <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"p=Nm\\overline{v^2}/(3V)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">p=Nm\\overline{v^2}/(3V)</span>。状態方程式と比較すると，分子1個の平均運動エネルギーは①定数と絶対温度で決まる。同じ種類・同じ分子数の気体で温度だけを変えたときの速さの分布は②である。①と②の組合せを選べ。</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values structured-list--cols-2\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ア</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">気体定数／図(a)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">イ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">ボルツマン定数／図(a)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ウ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">アボガドロ定数／図(a)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">エ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">リュードベリ定数／図(a)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">オ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">気体定数／図(b)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">カ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">ボルツマン定数／図(b)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">キ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">アボガドロ定数／図(b)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ク</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">リュードベリ定数／図(b)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ケ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">気体定数／図(c)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">コ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">ボルツマン定数／図(c)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">サ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">アボガドロ定数／図(c)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">シ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">リュードベリ定数／図(c)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ス</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">気体定数／図(d)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">セ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">ボルツマン定数／図(d)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ソ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">アボガドロ定数／図(d)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">タ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">リュードベリ定数／図(d)</div></div></div><figure class=\"batch-figure-pending\" data-figure-placeholder=\"true\" data-figure-id=\"q2-b-distribution-graphs\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"問題で参照する図（図版準備中）\"><strong>図版準備中</strong><p>問題で参照する図</p></div><figcaption>図の位置を確保しています。図を使う設問は確認完了まで演習対象外です。</figcaption></figure><h3>(C)</h3><p class=\"prose\">圧力 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"1.0\\times10^5\\ \\mathrm{Pa}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">1.0\\times10^5\\ \\mathrm{Pa}</span> に保ちながら理想気体を50 J加熱すると，体積が <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"2.0\\times10^{-4}\\ \\mathrm{m^3}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">2.0\\times10^{-4}\\ \\mathrm{m^3}</span> 増加した。内部エネルギーの増加量を選べ。</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values structured-list--cols-3\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ア</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">10 J</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">イ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">20 J</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ウ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">30 J</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">エ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">40 J</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">オ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">50 J</div></div></div><h3>(D)</h3><p class=\"prose\">9 cm離れた点P，Qから同位相で波長4 cmの波を発生させる。線分PQ上の節の間隔③とP・Q間にある節の数④を選べ。</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values structured-list--cols-3\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ア</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">2 cm／5個</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">イ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">2 cm／4個</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ウ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">2 cm／3個</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">エ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">4 cm／6個</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">オ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">4 cm／2個</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">カ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">4 cm／1個</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">キ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">8 cm／2個</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ク</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">8 cm／1個</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ケ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">8 cm／0個</div></div></div><h3>(E)</h3><p class=\"prose\">焦点距離20 cmの凹面鏡の前方60 cmに物体を置いた。像ができる側⑤，距離⑥，実像・虚像⑦の組合せを選べ。</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values structured-list--cols-2\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ア</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">前方／30 cm／実像</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">イ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">前方／30 cm／虚像</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ウ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">前方／40 cm／実像</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">エ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">前方／40 cm／虚像</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">オ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">後方／30 cm／実像</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">カ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">後方／30 cm／虚像</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">キ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">後方／40 cm／実像</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ク</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">後方／40 cm／虚像</div></div></div><h3>(F)</h3><p class=\"prose\">音源と観測者は静止し，右側の反射板が右向きに速さ <span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"v_R\" data-display-mode=\"false\">v_R</span> で動く。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f_R=\\boxed{⑧}f_0\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f_R=\\boxed{⑧}f_0</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"f=\\boxed{⑨}f_R\" data-display-mode=\"false\">f=\\boxed{⑨}f_R</span> の組合せを選べ。</p><figure class=\"batch-figure-pending\" data-figure-placeholder=\"true\" data-figure-id=\"q2-f-doppler-setup\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"問題で参照する図（図版準備中）\"><strong>図版準備中</strong><p>問題で参照する図</p></div><figcaption>図の位置を確保しています。図を使う設問は確認完了まで演習対象外です。</figcaption></figure><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values structured-list--cols-2\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ア</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V/(V-v_R)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">V/(V-v_R)</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V/(V+v_R)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">V/(V+v_R)</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">イ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V/(V-v_R)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">V/(V-v_R)</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(V-v_R)/V\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(V-v_R)/V</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ウ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V/(V-v_R)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">V/(V-v_R)</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(V+v_R)/V\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(V+v_R)/V</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">エ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V/(V+v_R)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">V/(V+v_R)</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V/(V-v_R)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">V/(V-v_R)</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">オ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V/(V+v_R)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">V/(V+v_R)</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(V-v_R)/V\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(V-v_R)/V</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">カ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V/(V+v_R)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">V/(V+v_R)</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(V+v_R)/V\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(V+v_R)/V</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">キ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(V-v_R)/V\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(V-v_R)/V</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V/(V-v_R)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">V/(V-v_R)</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ク</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(V-v_R)/V\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(V-v_R)/V</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V/(V+v_R)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">V/(V+v_R)</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ケ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(V-v_R)/V\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(V-v_R)/V</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(V+v_R)/V\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(V+v_R)/V</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">コ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(V+v_R)/V\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(V+v_R)/V</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V/(V-v_R)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">V/(V-v_R)</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">サ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(V+v_R)/V\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(V+v_R)/V</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"V/(V+v_R)\" data-display-mode=\"false\">V/(V+v_R)</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">シ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(V+v_R)/V\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(V+v_R)/V</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"(V-v_R)/V\" data-display-mode=\"false\">(V-v_R)/V</span></div></div></div><h3>(G)</h3><p class=\"prose\">ミリカンの油滴実験で，平行板間の帯電油滴にX線を当てて電荷を変化させた。この実験から分かったことを選べ。</p><figure class=\"batch-figure-pending\" data-figure-placeholder=\"true\" data-figure-id=\"q2-g-millikan\"><div role=\"img\" aria-label=\"問題で参照する図（図版準備中）\"><strong>図版準備中</strong><p>問題で参照する図</p></div><figcaption>図の位置を確保しています。図を使う設問は確認完了まで演習対象外です。</figcaption></figure><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ア</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">電荷には正と負の2種類がある。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">イ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">重力と空気抵抗がつり合う。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ウ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">油滴は振動しながら上昇する。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">エ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">油滴の電荷は，ある一定値の整数倍である。</div></div></div><h3>(H)</h3><p class=\"prose\">静止電子を20 kVで加速した。得るエネルギー⑩とX線の最短波長⑪を選べ。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"e=1.6\\times10^{-19}\\ \\mathrm{C}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">e=1.6\\times10^{-19}\\ \\mathrm{C}</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"h=6.6\\times10^{-34}\\ \\mathrm{J\\,s}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">h=6.6\\times10^{-34}\\ \\mathrm{J\\,s}</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"c=3.0\\times10^8\\ \\mathrm{m/s}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">c=3.0\\times10^8\\ \\mathrm{m/s}</span>。</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values structured-list--cols-2\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ア</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"1.6\\times10^{-15}\\ \\mathrm{J}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">1.6\\times10^{-15}\\ \\mathrm{J}</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"4.1\\times10^{-11}\\ \\mathrm{m}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">4.1\\times10^{-11}\\ \\mathrm{m}</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">イ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"1.6\\times10^{-15}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">1.6\\times10^{-15}</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"6.2\\times10^{-11}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">6.2\\times10^{-11}</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ウ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"1.6\\times10^{-15}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">1.6\\times10^{-15}</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"8.3\\times10^{-11}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">8.3\\times10^{-11}</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">エ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3.2\\times10^{-15}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">3.2\\times10^{-15}</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"4.1\\times10^{-11}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">4.1\\times10^{-11}</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">オ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3.2\\times10^{-15}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">3.2\\times10^{-15}</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"6.2\\times10^{-11}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">6.2\\times10^{-11}</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">カ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"3.2\\times10^{-15}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">3.2\\times10^{-15}</span>／<span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"8.3\\times10^{-11}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">8.3\\times10^{-11}</span></div></div></div><h3>(I)</h3><p class=\"prose\">約100 Vで加速した電子を結晶に当てる実験が示したことを選べ。</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ア</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">生じるX線スペクトルから電子の波動性が分かる。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">イ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">ド・ブロイは電子を加速する必要があることを示した。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ウ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">電子の物質波の波長がX線程度となり，結晶回折から波動性が分かる。</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">エ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">散乱前後の電子のエネルギー損失を測る。</div></div></div><h3>(J)</h3><p class=\"prose\">透過力が大きく電離作用が小さい⑫，両者が中程度の⑬，透過力が小さく電離作用が大きい⑭に，α線・β線・γ線を対応させる。</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values structured-list--cols-3\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ア</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">α／β／γ</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">イ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">α／γ／β</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ウ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">β／α／γ</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">エ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">β／γ／α</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">オ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">γ／α／β</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">カ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">γ／β／α</div></div></div><h3>(K)</h3><p class=\"prose\">半減期8.0日のヨウ素131が初め8.0 gあった。24日後の質量を選べ。</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values structured-list--cols-3\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ア</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">1.0 g</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">イ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">2.0 g</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ウ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">3.0 g</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">エ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">4.0 g</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">オ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">5.0 g</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">カ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">6.0 g</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">キ</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">7.0 g</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ク</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">8.0 g</div></div></div><h3>(L)</h3><p class=\"prose\">次の核反応のうち，核融合反応でないものの組合せを選べ。</p><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values structured-list--cols-2\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">(1)</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}^{2}_{1}\\mathrm{H}+{}^{3}_{1}\\mathrm{H}\\rightarrow{}^{4}_{2}\\mathrm{He}+{}^{1}_{0}\\mathrm{n}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}^{2}_{1}\\mathrm{H}+{}^{3}_{1}\\mathrm{H}\\rightarrow{}^{4}_{2}\\mathrm{He}+{}^{1}_{0}\\mathrm{n}</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">(2)</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}^{210}_{82}\\mathrm{Pb}\\rightarrow{}^{210}_{83}\\mathrm{Bi}+e^-\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}^{210}_{82}\\mathrm{Pb}\\rightarrow{}^{210}_{83}\\mathrm{Bi}+e^-</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">(3)</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}^{226}_{88}\\mathrm{Ra}\\rightarrow{}^{222}_{86}\\mathrm{Rn}+{}^{4}_{2}\\mathrm{He}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}^{226}_{88}\\mathrm{Ra}\\rightarrow{}^{222}_{86}\\mathrm{Rn}+{}^{4}_{2}\\mathrm{He}</span></div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">(4)</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\"><span class=\"math-inline\" data-katex=\"{}^{235}_{92}\\mathrm{U}+{}^{1}_{0}\\mathrm{n}\\rightarrow{}^{141}_{56}\\mathrm{Ba}+{}^{92}_{36}\\mathrm{Kr}+3{}^{1}_{0}\\mathrm{n}\" data-display-mode=\"false\">{}^{235}_{92}\\mathrm{U}+{}^{1}_{0}\\mathrm{n}\\rightarrow{}^{141}_{56}\\mathrm{Ba}+{}^{92}_{36}\\mathrm{Kr}+3{}^{1}_{0}\\mathrm{n}</span></div></div></div><div class=\"structured-list structured-list--values structured-list--cols-3\" role=\"list\"><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">ア</div><div class=\"structured-list__text\">(1)</div></div><div class=\"structured-list__item\" role=\"listitem\"><div class=\"structured-list__label\">イ</div><div class=\"structured-l